 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "When...",
     "texto": [
      "A sentence with **когда** can indicate the moment of an action: **Когда я дома, я отдыхаю** («When I am at home, I rest»). It can also come after the main clause: **Я отдыхаю, когда я дома**. Separate the time clause with a comma.",
      "In a question, **когда?** means «when?»: **Когда начинается фильм?** («When does the film start?»)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Time to do something",
     "texto": [
      "With **пора** you say «it is time to»: **Пора идти** (it is time to go). With **рано** and **поздно** you talk about the time: **Я встаю рано** (I get up early).",
      "**Детство** (childhood) goes with **в детстве**: **в детстве я жил в Мадриде** (as a child I lived in Madrid)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "«Когда» and time expressions",
